### Example Example 581

**Markdown input:**

```markdown
![foo](/url "title")
```

**Expected HTML output:**

```html
<p><img src="/url" alt="foo" title="title" /></p>
```

### Example Example 582

**Markdown input:**

```markdown
![foo *bar*]

[foo *bar*]: train.jpg "train & tracks"
```

**Expected HTML output:**

```html
<p><img src="train.jpg" alt="foo bar" title="train &amp; tracks" /></p>
```

